      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3304,
      "text": "As for those whom We gave the Scripture before this [Qur’an], they[24] do believe in it.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 28,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَصَصِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qasas",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Stories",
        "numberOfAyahs": 88,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 52,
      "juz": 20,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 392,
      "ruku": 339,
      "hizbQuarter": 157,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3305,
      "text": "When this [Qur’an] is recited to them, they say, “We believe in it, for it is the truth from our Lord. We had already submitted [as Muslims even] before this[25].”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 28,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَصَصِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qasas",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Stories",
        "numberOfAyahs": 88,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 53,
      "juz": 20,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 392,
      "ruku": 339,
      "hizbQuarter": 157,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3306,
      "text": "They will be given their reward twice for their patience, repelling evil with good[26], and for spending out of what We have provided for them.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 28,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَصَصِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qasas",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Stories",
        "numberOfAyahs": 88,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 54,
      "juz": 20,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 392,
      "ruku": 339,
      "hizbQuarter": 157,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3307,
      "text": "When they hear vain talk, they turn away from it and say, “We are accountable for our deeds and you for yours. Peace [is our response] to you[27]! We do not want [to be with] the ignorant.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 28,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَصَصِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qasas",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Stories",
        "numberOfAyahs": 88,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 55,
      "juz": 20,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 392,
      "ruku": 339,
      "hizbQuarter": 157,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3308,
      "text": "You cannot guide whoever you like, but Allah guides whom He wills, and He knows best who will be guided.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 28,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَصَصِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qasas",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Stories",
        "numberOfAyahs": 88,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 56,
      "juz": 20,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 392,
      "ruku": 339,
      "hizbQuarter": 157,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3309,
      "text": "They say, “If we follow the guidance with you [O Prophet], we will be snatched away from our land[28].” Have We not established for them a safe sanctuary [in Makkah] to which fruits of all kinds are brought as provision from Us? But most of them do not know.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 28,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَصَصِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qasas",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Stories",
        "numberOfAyahs": 88,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 57,
      "juz": 20,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 392,
      "ruku": 339,
      "hizbQuarter": 157,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3310,
      "text": "How many a town We have destroyed that were arrogant due to their affluence! Those are their dwellings which were never inhabited after them except briefly[29]. It is We Who were the Inheritors.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 28,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَصَصِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qasas",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Stories",
        "numberOfAyahs": 88,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 58,
      "juz": 20,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 392,
      "ruku": 339,
      "hizbQuarter": 157,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3311,
      "text": "Your Lord would never destroy towns without first sending to their main city a messenger, reciting to them Our verses. Nor would We destroy towns unless their people were wrongdoers.",
      "surah": {
